WwXX5HIt4ylqqRA&oe=6AFDCB3D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": ["cheap", "gunjack", "game", "eve", "shooter"], "long_description": "Strap on your Gear VR and become a Gunner - for gun and for glory!\n\nIn this sci-fi shooter, you'll aim and shoot your gun simply by looking at the enemy. Unload a devastating arsenal from your weapon turret, in intense gun battles against deadly fighters and planet-sized cruisers.\n\nYou'll join the fight as Hel \u2013 one tough Gunner holding her own against tenacious rebel forces. Blast your way across the galaxy in the story campaign and learn what it takes to be a Gunner. You can also take down waves of enemy units in a no-holds-barred Horde Mode showdown.\n\nEnlist now!", "short_description": "Strap on your Gear VR and become a Gunner - for gun and for glory!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "499802947304881", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": ["pascher", "gunjack", "Jeu", "eve", "tir"], "long_description": "SOYEZ VICTORIEUX\n\n2167.  Le Jour des tra\u00eetres. Des milliers de gens sont morts et des millions sont en danger, les rebelles ayant d\u00e9clar\u00e9 la guerre \u00e0 l\u2019humanit\u00e9 toute enti\u00e8re.\n\nDes tirailleurs d\u2019\u00e9lite issus de toute la galaxie activent leurs casques Samsung Gear VR pour accomplir leur devoir et repousser la menace rebelle. Arm\u00e9s de leurs fusils, ils prennent part \u00e0 un nouveau type de guerre sur fond d\u2019artillerie lourde et de justice patriote, d\u00e9truisant des l\u00e9gions enti\u00e8res de vaisseaux ennemis.\n\nFaites ce qui est juste. Activez votre Samsung Gear VR et devenez artilleur - la gloire par les armes\u00a0!", "short_description": "Faites ce qui est juste. Activez votre Samsung Gear VR et devenez artilleur - la gloire par les armes\u00a0!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "308011086839465", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": ["barato", "gunjack", "jogo", "eve", "tiro"], "long_description": "MIRE PARA VENCER\n\n2167. O Dia dos Traidores. Milhares foram mortos, milh\u00f5es correndo risco, os rebeldes declaram guerra ao resto da humanidade.\n\nGunners de elite em toda a gal\u00e1xia ativam seu acess\u00f3rio Samsung Gear VR para cumprir seu dever como \u00faltima defesa contra a amea\u00e7a rebelde. Empunhando suas armas, eles lutam em um novo tipo de guerra, destruindo legi\u00f5es de naves inimigas com artilharia mortal e com a justi\u00e7a ao seu lado.\n\nFa\u00e7a a coisa certa. Coloque seu acess\u00f3rio Samsung Gear VR e transforme-se no Gunner - para a gl\u00f3ria na guerra!", "short_description": "Fa\u00e7a a coisa certa. Coloque seu acess\u00f3rio Samsung Gear VR e transforme-se no Gunner - para a gl\u00f3ria na guerra!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.ndreams.com/company/terms-and-conditions/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.ndreams.com/company/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "nDreams", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.gunnergame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "535632297615233"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138834_267152726952804_527819417_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=APRI11fUZAIQ7kNvwE1dcMf&_nc_oc=AdrtxOJsSIWV3BlpS2ISSTsXv0JPsycHsE-46y_fokuZMdXeCs0Og5Vj5F84PYr4YVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1PnBlnYArdOfFNsCe92aN_DxFdhoQqNqMtYi0-1X_ag&oe=6AFDB854"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Gunner", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1430463600, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "795227263927852", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "863891333657154", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID"}, "iarc_cert": null, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2601144226835527", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306f\u52dd\u5229\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b2167\u5e74\u3002\u88cf\u5207\u308a\u306e\u65e5\u3002\u6570\u5343\u4eba\u304c\u547d\u3092\u843d\u3068\u3057\u3001\u6570\u5343\u4e07\u4eba\u306e\u547d\u304c\u8105\u5a01\u306b\u3055\u3089\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3002\u53cd\u4e71\u8ecd\u304c\u6226\u4e89\u3092\u4ed5\u639b\u3051\u3066\u304d\u305f\u306e\u3060\u3002\n\n\"\u9280\u6cb3\u3092\u80a1\u306b\u304b\u3051\u308b\u30a8\u30ea\u30fc\u30c8\u30ac\u30ca\u30fc\u304cSamsung Gear VR\u30d8\u30c3\u30c9\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u3092\u8d77\u52d5\u3059\u308b\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306f\u53cd\u4e71\u8ecd\u306e\u8105\u5a01\u304b\u3089\u6700\u5f8c\u306e\u9632\u885b\u7dda\u3092\u5b88\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u4efb\u52d9\u3092\u679c\u305f\u3059\u305f\u3081\u3002\u30ac\u30f3\u3092\u81ea\u5728\u306b\u64cd\u308a\u3001\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u6642\u4ee3\u306e\u6226\u4e89\u3092\u6226\u3048\u3002\u5f37\u529b\u306a\u7832\u5854\u3068\u6b63\u7fa9\u306e\u529b\u3067\u62bc\u3057\u5bc4\u305b\u308b\u6575\u306e\u5b87\u5b99\u8239\u3092\u7834\u58ca\u305b\u3088\u3002\n \n\u6b63\u7fa9\u3092\u8cab\u3051\u3002Samsung Gear VR\u3092\u8eab\u306b\u3064\u3051\u3001\u9283\u6483\u3068\u6804\u5149\u306e\u30ac\u30ca\u30fc\u3068\u306a\u308c\uff01", "short_description": "\u6b63\u7fa9\u3092\u8cab\u3051\u3002Samsung Gear VR\u3092\u8eab\u306b\u3064\u3051\u3001\u9283\u6483\u3068\u6804\u5149\u306e\u30ac\u30ca\u30fc\u3068\u306a\u308c\uff01"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1223343591201206", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SOYEZ VICTORIEUX\n\n2167.  Le Jour des tra\u00eetres. Des milliers de gens sont morts et des millions sont en danger, les rebelles ayant d\u00e9clar\u00e9 la guerre \u00e0 l\u2019humanit\u00e9 toute enti\u00e8re.\n\nDes tirailleurs d\u2019\u00e9lite issus de toute la galaxie activent leurs casques Samsung Gear VR pour accomplir leur devoir et repousser la menace rebelle. Arm\u00e9s de leurs fusils, ils prennent part \u00e0 un nouveau type de guerre sur fond d\u2019artillerie lourde et de justice patriote, d\u00e9truisant des l\u00e9gions enti\u00e8res de vaisseaux ennemis.\n\nFaites ce qui est juste. Activez votre Samsung Gear VR et devenez artilleur - la gloire par les armes\u00a0!", "short_description": "Faites ce qui est juste. Activez votre Samsung Gear VR et devenez artilleur - la gloire par les armes\u00a0!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "525290868387155", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u00a1A POR LA VICTORIA!\n\n2167. El d\u00eda del traidor. Miles de muertos; millones m\u00e1s bajo la amenaza rebelde en su guerra contra el resto de la humanidad.\n\nLos artilleros de \u00e9lite de toda la galaxia activan sus gafas Samsung Gear VR para cumplir con su deber y luchar contra la amenaza rebelde. Arma en mano, luchar\u00e1n en una nueva guerra, en la que destruir\u00e1n legiones de naves enemigas con artiller\u00eda mortal y justicia patri\u00f3tica.\n\nHaz lo correcto. Col\u00f3cate el Samsung Gear VR y convi\u00e9rtete en un artillero... \u00a1Por las armas y por la gloria!", "short_description": "Haz lo correcto. Col\u00f3cate el Samsung Gear VR y convi\u00e9rtete en un artillero... \u00a1Por las armas y por la gloria!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "511282476252882", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DEN SIEG IM VISIER\n\n2167.  Tag des Verrats.  Tausende Tote, Millionen bedroht - die Rebellen erkl\u00e4ren dem Rest der Menschheit den Krieg.\n\nElite-Gunner der gesamten Galaxie aktivieren ihre Samsung Gear Headsets im Abwehrkampf gegen die Bedrohung durch die Rebellen. Mit ihren Gesch\u00fctzen erleben sie eine neue Art der Kriegsf\u00fchrung, zerst\u00f6ren ganze Legionen an feindlichen Raumschiffen mit t\u00f6dlicher Pr\u00e4zision und f\u00fcr patriotische Gerechtigkeit.\n\nTu das Richtige. Schnall dir dein Samsung Gear VR um und werde zum Gunner - f\u00fcr Ruhm und Ehre!", "short_description": "Tu das Richtige. Schnall dir dein Samsung Gear VR um und werde zum Gunner - f\u00fcr Ruhm und Ehre!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "263806934611942", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gunner", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\uc2b9\ub9ac\ub97c \uc7c1\ucde8\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624\n\n2167\ub144. \ubc18\uc5ed\uc790\uc758 \ub0a0. \uc800\ud56d\uad70\uc774 \uc778\ub958\uc5d0 \ub300\ud56d\ud55c \uc804\uc7c1\uc744 \uc120\ud3ec\ud558\uba74\uc11c \uc218\ucc9c \uba85\uc774 \ubaa9\uc228\uc744 \uc783\uace0, \uc218\ubc31\ub9cc \uba85\uc774 \uc0dd\uba85\uc758 \uc704\ud611\uc744 \ubc1b\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc740\ud558\uacc4\uc758 \uc5d8\ub9ac\ud2b8 \ud3ec\uc218\ub4e4\uc740 Samsung Gear VR \ud5e4\ub4dc\uc14b\uc744 \ucc29\uc6a9\ud558\uace0 \uc800\ud56d\uad70\uc758 \uc704\ud611\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c \ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9 \ubc29\uc5b4 \uc784\ubb34\ub97c \uc218\ud589\ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uce58\uba85\uc801\uc778 \ub300\ud3ec\uc640 \uc778\ub958\ub97c \uc704\ud55c \uc815\uc758\ub85c \ubb34\uc7a5\ud558\uace0 \uc801\uc758 \uc6b0\uc8fc\uc120 \ud568\ub300\ub97c \ud30c\uad34\ud558\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc885\ub958\uc758 \uc804\uc7c1\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2f8\uc6b0\uac8c \ub420 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc778\ub958\ub97c \uc704\ud574 \uc2f8\uc6b0\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. Samsung Gear VR\uc744 \ucc29\uc6a9\ud558\uace0 \ub300\ud3ec\uc640 \uc601\uad11\uc744 \uc704\ud574 \uc804\ud22c\uc5d0 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624!", "short_description": "\uc778\ub958\ub97c \uc704\ud574 \uc2f8\uc6b0\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624. Samsung Gear VR\uc744 \ucc29\uc6a9\ud558\uace0 \ub300\ud3ec\uc640 \uc601\uad11\uc744 \uc704\ud574 \uc804\ud22c\uc5d0 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud558\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "520823701943188", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162753_650204498424526_959826468_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ebhiqSbHIwEQ7kNvwHlhonp&_nc_oc=AdqRJMgAfd-c1vgEVJh3Eux1a93CIYrm76fDbggi0i7N6b1jTw-RNXkOIZsKlXie3Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR6zcxJ-upUWQaTOh6QgpkLTtvabonVMiRnWvSj55iyaQ&oe=6AFDBFAB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "230904778061583", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162753_650204498424526_959826468_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ebhiqSbHIwEQ7kNvwHlhonp&_nc_oc=AdqRJMgAfd-c1vgEVJh3Eux1a93CIYrm76fDbggi0i7N6b1jTw-RNXkOIZsKlXie3Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_n